      "content": "transformation? i dont think you get it. i'm not transitioning. i'm finished. when everyone in my circle looks at me, they don't see a person, they see a cautionary tale. there's no 'rediscovering' anything when the foundation is just gone. it's just... it's quiet. everything is just so quiet and empty now. i'm just waiting for something to end.",
